  {
   "n": 11,
   "he": "וְאָז: \"תַּחְזְרִי. תָּמִיד חוֹזְרִים.\"",
   "translit": "Ve-az: \"Tachzeri. Tamid chozrim.\"",
   "en": "And then: \"Come back. People always come back.\"",
